  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After the tense confrontation with Xin Huimei, Chun Yuqiao is in severe pain from stomach issues. Bu Xiaogu finds him struggling backstage and guides him to a lounge to rest. Listen to their interaction.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "老大，你先歇会儿。我给你拿药去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，后台布局调整了，休息室在这边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那边又发生这么大场戏，胃不疼就怪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛苦你了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是我第二次看见你。给你添麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那没什么事我就去忙了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let us unpack what they say. Bu Xiaogu finds him clutching his stomach.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "老大，你先歇会儿。我给你拿药去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, you rest here for a bit. I will go get your medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，后台布局调整了，休息室在这边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Chun, the backstage layout has been adjusted, the lounge is over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那边又发生这么大场戏，胃不疼就怪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With such a huge drama happening over there, it would be strange if your stomach did not hurt.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛苦你了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for your hard work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是我第二次看见你。给你添麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the second time I am seeing you. I caused you trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那没什么事我就去忙了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then if there is nothing else, I will go get busy.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "老大，你先歇会儿。我给你拿药去。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，后台布局调整了，休息室在这边。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那边又发生这么大场戏，胃不疼就怪了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛苦你了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是我第二次看见你。给你添麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那没什么事我就去忙了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even while in pain, Chun Yuqiao takes a moment to acknowledge Xiaogu's hard work. You learned the words for \"layout\", \"lounge\", and \"stomach\". See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
